Mode: ORDERING
The question must ask the user to arrange items in the correct order.
The "answers" array must contain ONLY the correct ordered items (no incorrect options).

Example:
{
  "questions": [
    {
      "question": "Put these events in the correct order:",
      "answers": [
        {"answer": "Wake up"},
        {"answer": "Brush teeth"},
        {"answer": "Have breakfast"}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
